{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"thread\": \"一个人逐渐爱上另一个人，享受彼此亲近，却始终害怕自己的在乎成为负担，也害怕这份美好随时会消失。他在想坦白、想要保证和想退回自我之间反复摇摆，最后终于接受未来无法保证，不再压抑自己的喜欢，也不再强求一个永远的承诺。\",\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\"sec\":\"S01\",\"caught\":\"心动却怕成负担\",\"echo\":\"\",\"why\":\"能\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S02\",\"caught\":\"亲近甜蜜又舍不得\",\"echo\":\"S01\",\"why\":\"能\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S03\",\"caught\":\"沉醉当下却难开口\",\"echo\":\"S02\",\"why\":\"勉强\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S04\",\"caught\":\"想坦白又怕失去\",\"echo\":\"S01\",\"why\":\"能\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S05\",\"caught\":\"露出喜欢后不安\",\"echo\":\"S04\",\"why\":\"能\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S06\",\"caught\":\"亲近后反而孤单\",\"echo\":\"S05\",\"why\":\"勉强\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S07\",\"caught\":\"欲望执念难抽身\",\"echo\":\"S06\",\"why\":\"勉强\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S08\",\"caught\":\"放下戒备回应亲近\",\"echo\":\"S02\",\"why\":\"能\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S09\",\"caught\":\"渴望与不安拉扯\",\"echo\":\"S04\",\"why\":\"勉强\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S10\",\"caught\":\"先不猜未来\",\"echo\":\"S09\",\"why\":\"能\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S11\",\"caught\":\"承认感情仍愿陪伴\",\"echo\":\"S01\",\"why\":\"能\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S12\",\"caught\":\"不再压抑全心付出\",\"echo\":\"S11\",\"why\":\"能\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S13\",\"caught\":\"想要保证却藏不回\",\"echo\":\"S05\",\"why\":\"能\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S14\",\"caught\":\"放下永远的保证\",\"echo\":\"S01\",\"why\":\"勉强\"}\n  ],\n  \"overall\": \"最吃力的是 S06—S07：情绪突然从亲近转向孤独、欲望和执念，词语比较抽象，缺少明确的事情作为连接，不容易一下理解他为什么发生这种变化。最抓人的是 S01—S05 和 S13—S14，反复出现的想靠近、怕打扰、想坦白又怕失去形成了很清楚的情感拉扯，最后不再索要永远的保证，也让整个故事有了收束。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3a8ca9eb-a486-4a3c-a0c9-fb62dad5bfc1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T190143316587Z", "elapsed_seconds": 57.469, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T19:02:40.787770+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "966e45e75e0f7af620921b5d18b778cff1bc7bc3712f89d1e6deabca69456834", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T190143316587Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "85d5914dd1cc36e8aa85dabde193014253f288bb262b1eea3c1bb307aaa919e5"}}}
